Description: Morse Micro MM6108 802.11ah (Wi-Fi HaLow) wireless driver - DKMS source
 Out-of-tree kernel driver for the Morse Micro MM6108 Wi-Fi HaLow (802.11ah)
 wireless chipset.
 .
 The driver supports SDIO, SPI, and USB bus transports. It requires firmware
 files from the mm6108-firmware package to be installed in /lib/firmware/morse/.
 .
 This package provides the source code for the morse kernel modules and uses
 DKMS to automatically build them for each installed kernel version.
